* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RLISAB - List Active Bundles
*
* Maintenance
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
* mrs 93-11-23 s(184626) cleanup and various changes
* jwo 97-12-04 p(167749) Avoid NAT3009
* gw  98-03-13 s(278970) accept search values from direct command
*                        and save them in independent variables
*              --------> To relieve preformance problems introduced a
*              --------> 'quick and dirty' solution in copying this
*              --------> program RLISAB to RLISABB.
*              --------> RLISAB will only be used if no bundle is given
*              --------> as selection.
*              --------> Reading is done by AB-OPENTIME-BUNDLE.
*              --------> In all other cases RLISABB gets control and
*              --------> reads by AB-BUNDLE-RNB-INV which will be much
*              --------> faster. In fact it will be fastest if the whole
*              --------> bundle name is given as selection.
* gw  98-03-27 s(276761) revive active bundle
*                        new messages 474, 475, maps rrevabm*
* gw  98-07-01 p(171994) discard quick and dirty solution RLISABB
*                        Handling for general users is now the same as
*                        for administrators, except that bundles for
*                        which there is no grant are not highlighted and
*                        the line command field is protected.
* gw  98-07-16 p(172297) build list active bundle redesign
* gw  98-07-20 p(172376) list active bundle direct command with wildcard
* jvd 98-09-10 p(164220) NOM141ÖNAT23 > 9,999,999 lines
* sju 99-11-29 p(188153) restrict active bundle display
* sju 00-01-14 p(190849) differenf display formats for abun selection
* sju 00-03-03 p(192050) reset selection criteria on entry
* wcd 00-04-01 CE 7267   New PFkey for additional printers in RPFK---L
*                        & VABUND-L changes
* xsisgg 00-08-16 CE7461 Extend Report and Bundle names
* xsetoba 02-04-18 (CE5903) BOT doesn't work
* xsetggr 02-07-26 (CE7553) change err msg 474 to 476(474 got used  for
*                           something else
* sju 02-08-01 p(225932) Position and selection criteria lost after RP
* xsetggr 03-02-25 p(222810) allow modification only of open bundles
* xsetggr 03-08-14 p(204583) change hard coded text to msg nr in log msg
* XSETHZ 04-05-24 (CE5903)
* sju 04-06-08 p(253989) Selection by bundle name (no *) very slow
* HH 040825 FORMATTING T CHANGED;
* sju 04-11-04 p(258404) Selection by bundle-name* very slow
*                        Introduce support for a new active bundle list
*                        format (3) to show bundles in ascending bundle
*                        name/run number (issues much fewer Adabas
*                        calls). Note: user profile maintenance does not
*                        yet support abun list format 3.
* xsetggr 2005-10-26 p(270950) ISN fields must be P10, not P8
* xsetggr 2007-05-04 NOM3201   Support P11 format run numbers
* xsetggr 2007-12-20 p(300300) prevent loose selection
* fhi     2008-07-24 P307319   restow due to changes in DDM NRM-BUNDLE-CONTENTS
* splildav 2009-03-30 P304322  For Unix, assume 'revive to DB'          ONTENTS
* xsetggr  2009-09-01 P319642  save global values before stack screen
* fhi     2010-03-05 P307403 Don't use text and binary reports mixed
* xsetggr 2010-03-16 P307403 backouted *DATA condition, tag deleted
* fhi     2010-09-03 NOMALL-97 Extend message line
* xsetggr 2011-07-28 NOMALL-982 allow list large bundles > 9999 reports
* xsetggr 2012-04-23 NOMALL-1136 corrections of using grants
* xsetggr 2012-09-19 NOMALL-89 implement line command validation check
* fhi     2013-06-04 OPO-36    Fill field AR-ACTIVE
* xsetggr 2013-06-19 NOMALL-1198 restow due corrections in C-CHKLC
* SU1     2013-07-17 remove empty copy code CSTARTLS
* SU2     2014-07-01 NOMALL-1281 show last update user+date
* SU3     2014-07-01 NOMALL-1279 fill fields for Adabas Vista
* SU4     2016-01-19 NOMALL-1802 do not update Adabas Vista fields
* SU5     2016-08-01 NOMALL-1518 NOM3.5 deactivate opt.Compiler
* BLI     2017-07-17 NOMALL-1984 differ MODIFY/DISPLAY, also C-CHKLC
* SU6     2018-02-15 NOMALL-1823 NOM 3.5: remove CONNECT
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA GLOBAL USING  NRM-GL
INDEPENDENT
