    3 #SCREEN-FIL              (A6)              /* 2600
  2 REDEFINE    L-SCREEN-SAVE-AREA
    3 L-SCREEN-SEGMENT         (A200/1:13)
  2 REDEFINE    L-SCREEN-SAVE-AREA
    3 L-SCREEN-SEG             (13)
      4 L-SCREEN-SEG-F         (A199)
      4 L-SCREEN-SEG-L         (A1)
  2 L-SCREEN-SEG-FLAG          (L/1:13)
*
1 I                            (N5)
1 #CONFIRMED                   (L)
